# 0329a6 (includes 0329b) = 0329a5 + L1 port relocation
# (rearm/reset/IRQ/attach/reattach/heartbeat/ep0_window) and L4-L6
# gadget relocation (EP0 FIFO/state machine, descriptors, function
# registry, standard requests, vendor 0x21-0x2E handlers) in one CL.
# Two TUs (ruby_usb_port, ruby_usb_gadget) plus the shared MAC map
# header keep the layers; ruby_usb.c keeps accessors, echo/log data
# plane, command parser, dumps and the probe entry.
